# You can add here your custom apt repositories

# r7 (+r7apt1): this port's own patched-package overlay. Without this, any
# apt operation (a background PackageKit refresh, a manual "check for
# updates", or a plain `apt upgrade`) only sees the official Droidian repo,
# which happily "upgrades" our patched phosh/clock/scale-persistence/etc.
# packages back down to stock the moment a matching name exists there -
# traced live 2026-08-09 after a user report that a system update reset the
# clock-position fix, and confirmed by finding phosh.service back at its
# stock Conflicts=getty@tty1.service (the black-screen-forever fix) on a
# device that had supposedly shipped with it patched. Signed with the key at
# /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/community-samsung-r7.gpg (this package ships it),
# so no [trusted=yes] is needed.
deb https://raw.githubusercontent.com/note10lite-droidian/droidian-samsung-r7/droidian-101/apt/ ./
